title: The Cuno Strikes
subtitle: A strike wave brings down the government.
new-page: true
tags: rf_event
view-if: year = 1923 and month >= 8
max-visits: 1

= The Cuno Strikes

In August the dollar buys millions of marks. Printers at the state mint walk out and the money stops. Strikes spread across Berlin and the industrial regions, many led by Communist factory councils. On 12 August Chancellor Cuno resigns. Gustav Stresemann forms a grand coalition that includes the <span class="p-spd">SPD</span>.

The party called the strikes. What does it do with them?

- @escalate
- @front
- @end

@escalate
title: Push the strike toward a general strike and a fight for power.
subtitle: Pleases the <span class="f-left">Left</span> and <span class="f-ultra">Ultra-Left</span>. Angers the <span class="f-right">Right</span>. Raises the revolutionary situation.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.lean(Q, {left: 4, ultra: 3, right: -3});
Q.rev_situation += 10;
Q.readiness += 3;
Q.repression += 6;
Q.spd_relation -= 4;
!}

The strike committees call for more. In some places police fire on demonstrators. The <span class="p-spd">SPD</span>, now in government, appeals for calm.

@front
title: Turn it into a joint front with <span class="p-spd">SPD</span> workers against the new government.
subtitle: Pleases the <span class="f-right">Right</span> and <span class="f-center">Middle Group</span>. Angers the <span class="f-ultra">Ultra-Left</span>. Improves relations with the <span class="p-spd">SPD</span>.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.lean(Q, {right: 4, center: 2, ultra: -3});
Q.spd_relation += 8;
Q.union_influence += 5;
!}

Joint strike committees with <span class="p-spd">SPD</span> members stay together after the strike ends. The <span class="p-spd">SPD</span> leaders who joined Stresemann's government find their own members harder to manage.

@end
title: Win what can be won and call the strikes off.
subtitle: Brings in members. Pleases the <span class="f-center">Middle Group</span>. Angers the <span class="f-left">Left</span>.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.lean(Q, {center: 3, left: -3});
Q.members += 6;
Q.union_influence += 2;
!}

The strikers win wage indexing in several industries. The party gains members and loses some of its fire.
